            ],
            "Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block's settings \u2192 After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.": [
                "Bir e-posta listesi servisini bir kez ba\u011flay\u0131n; ard\u0131ndan herhangi bir form, formu dolduran ki\u015fileri listelerinizden birine ekleyebilir (form blo\u011funun ayarlar\u0131 \u2192 G\u00f6nderdikten sonra). Anahtarlar servis ile kontrol edilir, bu sitede \u015fifrelenmi\u015f olarak saklan\u0131r ve bir daha asla g\u00f6sterilmez."
            ],
            "Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a \"Conversion event\" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.": [
                "Form g\u00f6nderimlerini ve buton t\u0131klamalar\u0131n\u0131 kod yazmadan analitik ara\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131za g\u00f6nderin. Bir servisi atlamak i\u00e7in ID alan\u0131n\u0131 bo\u015f b\u0131rak\u0131n. Butonlar\u0131n Geli\u015fmi\u015f panelinde bir \"D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcm olay\u0131\" alan\u0131 yer al\u0131r. \u00c7erez banner'\u0131 etkinken, ziyaret\u00e7i onay verene kadar hi\u00e7bir \u015fey y\u00fcklenmez."
            ],
            "Google Analytics 4 measurement ID": [
                "Google Analytics 4 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm kimli\u011fi"
            ],
            "Google Tag Manager container ID": [
                "Google Tag Manager kapsay\u0131c\u0131 kimli\u011fi"
            ],
            "Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)": [
                "Meta Piksel Kimli\u011fi (Meta Olay Y\u00f6neticisi'nde g\u00f6sterilen numara)"
            ],
            "Load these tags on my site": [
                "Bu etiketleri siteme y\u00fckle"
            ],
            "Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.": [
                "Tema veya ba\u015fka bir eklenti bunlar\u0131 zaten ekliyorsa kapat\u0131n; etkinlikler yine de g\u00f6nderilir."
            ],
            "Event name for form submissions": [
                "Form g\u00f6nderimleri i\u00e7in etkinlik ad\u0131"
            ],
            "The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for \"save\"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays \"denied\", and the scripts you list stay switched off.": [
                "Banner, bloklarla tasarlad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z bir a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r penceredir. D\u00fc\u011fmeleri #consent-accept, #consent-reject ve #consent-save adreslerine ba\u011flan\u0131r (\"kaydet\" i\u00e7in analytics ve marketing adl\u0131 onay kutular\u0131yla); herhangi bir yerdeki #consent-open ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 onu yeniden g\u00f6sterir. Bir ziyaret\u00e7i kabul edene kadar izleme etiketleri y\u00fcklenmez, Google Consent Mode \"reddedildi\" olarak kal\u0131r ve listeledi\u011finiz komut dosyalar\u0131 kapal\u0131 kal\u0131r."
            ],
            "Create a ready-made banner": [
                "Haz\u0131r bir banner olu\u015ftur"
            ],
