                "Banner"
            ],
            "Choose a popup\u2026": [
                "Bir a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r pencere se\u00e7in\u2026"
            ],
            "%s (draft)": [
                "%s (taslak)"
            ],
            "Edit the banner": [
                "Banner\u0131 d\u00fczenle"
            ],
            "Remember the choice for (days)": [
                "(days) i\u00e7in se\u00e7imi hat\u0131rla"
            ],
            "Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no": [
                "Avrupa Birli\u011fi, AEA ve \u0130ngiltere d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda: ziyaret\u00e7i reddedene kadar y\u00fckleme takibi"
            ],
            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "Kapal\u0131: her ziyaret\u00e7i \u00f6nce kabul etmelidir (en kat\u0131 kural ve varsay\u0131lan). A\u00e7\u0131k: yaln\u0131zca bar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131n\u0131z veya CDN'iniz ziyaret\u00e7inin \u00fclkesini bildirdi\u011finde (\u00f6rne\u011fin Cloudflare'in CF-IPCountry \u00fcst bilgisi) ve bu \u00fclke EU, EEA, UK ve Switzerland d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda oldu\u011funda. Banner yine de g\u00f6sterilir ve bilinmeyen bir \u00fclke EU i\u00e7inde kabul edilir."
            ],
            "Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)": [
                "Onay al\u0131n\u0131ncaya kadar bekletilecek di\u011fer betikler (tan\u0131mlay\u0131c\u0131:analytics veya tan\u0131mlay\u0131c\u0131:marketing, virg\u00fclle ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f)"
            ],
